sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor M as Manager
    participant UI as :ConsoleUI
    participant G as :Game
    participant AS as :ArrivalSchedule
    participant HH as :HappyHour
    participant H as host:Host
    participant R as :Restaurant
    participant V as chloe:VIPCustomer
    participant T as table1:Table

    Note over M,T: Part 1 of 6. Stage 3 victory run (scripts/stage3-victory.txt), turn 7: VIP Chloe (#35;3) arrives, the manager switches on Happy Hour, and the Host seats her.

    loop for turn = 1 to 18, while not game.isOver()
        UI->>+G: beginTurn()
        G->>+AS: arrivingOn(7)
        AS->>V: «create» VIPCustomer(3, "Chloe", 7)
        AS-->>-G: Optional(chloe)
        G->>R: admit(chloe)
        Note over R,V: Chloe joins the queue with satisfaction 100
        G-->>-UI: ARRIVAL event
        UI-->>M: dashboard and staff tasks
        opt game.canStartHappyHour()
            UI-->>M: happy hour now? [y/N]
            M->>UI: "y" (manager choice)
            alt answer is "y"
                UI->>+G: startHappyHour()
                G->>HH: activate(7)
                G->>+HH: refresh(restaurant, 7)
                HH->>R: awaitingService()
                R-->>HH: ben, chloe
                loop for each customer awaiting service
                    HH->>V: recover(15)
                end
                Note over HH,V: Chloe is already at 100 and gains nothing. Ben, waiting for his combo, goes from 64 to 79.
                HH-->>-G: refreshed: ben
                G-->>-UI: ActionResult.done (2 turns left)
            else answer is "n" or Enter
                Note over UI,HH: no Happy Hour: Chloe's Pasta would be quoted at $16.20 (part 2)
            end
        end
        M->>UI: "seat 3 1"
        UI->>+G: direct(host, cmd)
        G->>+H: perform(cmd, ctx)
        H->>H: carryOut(cmd, ctx)
        H->>R: seat(chloe, table1)
        R->>V: seatAt(table1)
        V->>T: assign(chloe)
        H-->>-G: ActionResult.done
        G-->>-UI: ActionResult.done
        Note over M,T: Turn 7 continues in part 2: the Waiter takes Chloe's order.
    end
